{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Rainbow of Desire 是一款把每週工作量視覺化的待辦工具，將行程畫成方格，工作重疊越多顏色越深，適合經常同時推進多項工作、又想善用零碎時間的人。目前該 App 終生版限時免費兌換中，原價為 US $9.99。</p>\n\n<h2>把大工作拆成五分鐘碎片</h2>\n<p>把每週行程畫成方格，工作重疊越多顏色越深，讓你未踏入那週已先看見負荷。大型工作可拆成步驟，再以兩個問題分類：開始前是否需要熱身，以及能否在五分鐘內完成；兩者皆是的才算碎片，可在零碎空檔隨手推進，其餘歸入需預留時間的區塊。核心功能免費且無需註冊，Pro 為一次性購買。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-578-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-579-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-580-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-581-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-582-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-583-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<p>macOS 版</p>\n<img alt=\"rainbow mac2\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/rainbow-mac2-1024x640.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"rainbow mac1\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/rainbow-mac1.webp\"/>\n<h2>限時免費兌換終生版</h2>\n<p>Rainbow of Desire 終生版限時免費中，用戶透過兌換連結領取，注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。兌換連結數目有限，額滿即止。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-24T21:59:05.945295+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}